## Counter application

This template also includes a React + Vite frontend. Read `README.md` for the
local startup workflow and `web/AGENTS.md` before changing the frontend.

- `web/`: browser UI and temporary native wallet.
- `scripts/`: contract build, local deployment, and Vite startup.
- `web/generated/`: regenerate bindings with `npm run contract:build`.
- `.thruput/app.json`: save a fresh deployment with `npm run contract:deploy`.

Use the project's local-node workflow. The hosted Devnet quickstarts describe
a different setup.
